      "description": "An attacker reportedly obtained Wagyu's XMR1 deployer signing key through a breach of third-party hosting infrastructure that retained files from a previously deleted server. The attacker transferred 5.2M XMR1 from the deployer account to a newly created wallet and sold approximately 369,623 tokens into Hyperliquid's spot order book for $13.51M USDC, causing XMR1 to lose approximately 99.8% of its market value. The proceeds were converted into ETH and transferred across Arbitrum and Ethereum"
